# =====================================================================
# 小说知识库专属规则（Vault 事实源 + 运行时产物）
# =====================================================================

# 索引可随时从 Markdown 重建，不入版本库
.novel_system/index.sqlite
.novel_system/index.sqlite-wal
.novel_system/index.sqlite-shm
# 原子写入残留：rename 被环境拒绝时会留下 .tmp_* 半成品，永远不该入库
.tmp_*
# 运行时产物
.novel_system/locks/
.novel_system/backups/
.novel_system/staging/txn/
.novel_system/staging/draft/
.novel_system/staging/preflight/
.novel_system/logs/*.log

# Obsidian 与系统噪音
.DS_Store
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspaces.json
.obsidian/cache
# 插件是本地环境（二进制/版本各异），只保留启用的插件清单
.obsidian/plugins/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Python 代码产物（代码位于 00_System/novel_system）
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.pytest_tmp/
.venv/
venv/
build/
dist/

# =====================================================================
# 以下为 GitHub 官方 Python 模板（合并自远程初始提交，保持上游同步）
# =====================================================================

# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
*.py[codz]
*$py.class

# C extensions
*.so

# Distribution / packaging
.Python
develop-eggs/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# PyInstaller
#   Usually these files are written by a python script from a template
#   before PyInstaller builds the exe, so as to inject date/other infos into it.
*.manifest
*.spec

# Installer logs
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

